OL,3,A'Not far enough' - US parents and teens
OL,4,Aon Meta's new limits for young users
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor Elizabeth Cardner, a mother of two
OL,7,Fgirls in Houston, Texas, Meta's new
OL,8,Flimits on how teenagers can use its
OL,9,Fplatforms are a welcome sign that more
OL,10,Fpeople are aware of social media's
OL,11,Fpotential dangers.
OL,13,FBut, she tells the BBC, they probably
OL,14,Fwon't help much in the long-term.
OL,16,F"It will save a few arguments at home,
OL,17,Fbut it doesn't go far enough," she
OL,18,Fsays.
